+      on-device verification.
+- [ ] Shade header: date at left, settings gear at right
+- [ ] KitKat clear-all button
+- [ ] Bottom drag handle
+- [ ] Carrier label at the bottom of the shade
+      Plan: SystemUI already ships com.android.keyguard.CarrierText plus
+      CarrierTextController (used by the keyguard); the work is adding the view
